{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-08_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-08","title":"应激反应","storyCode":"4-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-08_end.txt","sourceHash":"8e72e359c9aea5c567d29826c65b135bb193765933cc883b79bb9738a03463f8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在霜叶的带领下，一行找到了陨星与杰西卡，但杰西卡却因为此前的经历而陷入了巨大的恐惧。\n在阿米娅的引导下，她逐渐走出了恐惧。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在掩体后面，别开火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"看看我带了谁来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陨星，是我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"谁？难道是......阿米娅吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！你......你居然来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"见到你，真是，真是太好了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"——你不该来。这是个巨大的陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"让你来营救我们，代价太大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"这是个错误的决定......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"现在责怪她也没有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况，谁都看得出来你们根本没有机会逃出来......阿米娅是不会放弃你们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"我没在责怪她！只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。对不起，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的。见到你们平安，我就已经非常开心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......杰西卡她怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"她有点......被吓到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"本来是想等她振作起来，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"该说是留下了心理创伤......吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"霜叶，帮个忙。把她的手放在我的胳膊上，把她手指抓紧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——！！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_0"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_station"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我没事！只是......唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好强的......悲伤......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很模糊，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没问题的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一定要振作起来呀，杰西卡......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米娅......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......阿米娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，好了......已经没事了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡......你还好吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......我是在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......对不起......我没想到......我没想到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"那些，那些......呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我感受到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，我也经历过——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——想要逃跑，却走不动路——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——想要尖叫，却发不出声音——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂的，杰西卡......我也经历过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"站起来吧，杰西卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用再害怕了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你现在，和我们在一起。你不孤单，你身边永远有我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还得一起回罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"芙兰卡和雷蛇还在等你呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......你......刚才用了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可得......向凯尔希医生保密哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["霜叶"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["陨星"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["杰西卡"]}]}
